  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.notice
    Value: SPIKED
  - Key: item.mushroom_dose.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHOSE MUSHROOMS YOU SPIKE
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.name
    Value: Reveal Together
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.description
    Value: You and a player you pick each reveal one card, face up for everyone until
      the hand ends. They choose which of theirs.
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.notice
    Value: REVEALS WITH
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.prompt_own
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU WILL REVEAL
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.prompt_player
    Value: POINT AT WHO REVEALS ONE WITH YOU
  - Key: item.mutual_reveal.response
    Value: 'WANTS YOU TO REVEAL A CARD: POINT AT ONE'
  - Key: item.pair_lock_fold.name
    Value: Handcuffs
  - Key: item.pair_lock_fold.description
    Value: You and a chosen player cannot fold in the next round.
  - Key: item.pair_lock_fold.notice
    Value: HANDCUFFED
  - Key: item.pair_lock_items.name
    Value: No Items
  - Key: item.pair_lock_items.description
    Value: You and a chosen player cannot use items in the next round.
  - Key: item.pair_lock_items.notice
    Value: BLOCKED THE ITEMS OF
  - Key: item.pair_lock.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHO IS LOCKED WITH YOU
  - Key: item.peek_board.name
    Value: Spatula
  - Key: item.peek_board.description
    Value: See one board card before it is revealed. You cannot fold this round.
  - Key: item.peek_board.notice
    Value: PEEKED AT THE BOARD
  - Key: item.peek_board_main.description
    Value: See the last board card before it is revealed. You cannot fold this round.
  - Key: item.peek_hand.name
    Value: Peek
  - Key: item.peek_hand.description
    Value: See one card of a player still in the hand. They are told which card you
      saw.
  - Key: item.peek_hand.notice
    Value: PEEKED AT
  - Key: item.place_on_board.name
    Value: Cigarette
  - Key: item.place_on_board.description
    Value: Place one of your cards face up on the board for everyone to see, and
      draw a new card from the deck in its place.
  - Key: item.place_on_board.notice
    Value: PLACED A CARD
  - Key: item.place_on_board.prompt
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU PLACE ON THE BOARD
  - Key: item.raise_stakes.name
    Value: Raise
  - Key: item.raise_stakes.description
    Value: Every bet in the next round adds one more mushroom, yours included.
  - Key: item.raise_stakes.notice
    Value: RAISED STAKES
  - Key: item.random_suit.name
    Value: Dice
  - Key: item.random_suit.description
    Value: One of your cards keeps its rank and changes to a random different suit.
  - Key: item.random_suit.notice
    Value: CHANGED SUIT
  - Key: item.random_suit.prompt
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD TO CHANGE
  - Key: item.rate_shift.name
    Value: Panties
  - Key: item.rate_shift.description
    Value: 'Choose a player: their hallucination rate goes up or down by {0}%, at
      random.'
  - Key: item.rate_shift.raised
    Value: +{0}% HALLUCINATION TO
  - Key: item.rate_shift.lowered
    Value: -{0}% HALLUCINATION TO
  - Key: item.rate_shift.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHOSE HALLUCINATION YOU CHANGE
  - Key: item.shared_roll.name
    Value: Beer
  - Key: item.shared_roll.description
    Value: You and a player you choose each make a Death Roll at the same time, using
      your own hallucination rate.
  - Key: item.shared_roll.notice
    Value: MADE A DEATH ROLL WITH
  - Key: item.shared_roll.prompt
    Value: POINT AT WHO MAKES A DEATH ROLL WITH YOU
  - Key: item.swap_board.name
    Value: Cigarette
  - Key: item.swap_board.description
    Value: A face-down board card is revealed to everyone, then swapped with one
      of your cards. Your card stays face up on the board.
  - Key: item.swap_board.notice
    Value: SWAPPED A BOARD CARD
  - Key: item.swap_board.prompt
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU PUT ON THE BOARD
  - Key: item.swap_hand.name
    Value: Knife
  - Key: item.swap_hand.description
    Value: Swap one of your cards with a player still in the hand. They choose which
      of theirs to give.
  - Key: item.swap_hand.notice
    Value: SWAPPED WITH
  - Key: item.swap_hand.prompt_own
    Value: POINT AT THE CARD YOU GIVE
  - Key: item.swap_hand.prompt_player
    Value: POINT AT WHO YOU SWAP WITH
  - Key: item.swap_hand.response
    Value: 'wants to swap cards with you: choose one to give'
  - Key: item.table_reveal.name
    Value: Megaphone
  - Key: item.table_reveal.description
    Value: Every player still in the hand reveals one random card to everyone this
